#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "68_Shinya"
msgid "The hell, man?"
msgstr "¿Qué demonios, viejo?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Woman"
msgid "Shinya-kun! Are you okay!?"
msgstr "¡Shinya-kun! ¡¿Estás bien?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "104_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey, Yuya? I have someone here you might want to talk to."
msgstr "Oye, Yuya. Tengo a alguien aquí con quien quizá quieras hablar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Yuya"
msgid "I don't get it, Shinya. Why would you do something like\\r\nthis?"
msgstr "No entiendo, Shinya. ¿Por qué harías algo\\r\ncomo esto?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Shinya"
msgid "I don't gotta answer you."
msgstr "No tengo por qué responderte."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Yuya"
msgid "Shinya..."
msgstr "Shinya..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Kazuki"
msgid "(How are you going to respond, Yuya?)"
msgstr "(¿Cómo vas a responder, Yuya?)"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Yuya"
msgid "Listen up, Shinya. You're gonna pay off the 5 mil you tried\\r\nto pin on Mitsuru. Every last yen of it."
msgstr "Escucha, Shinya. Vas a pagar los 5 millones que intentaste atribuirle a Mitsuru.\\r\nHasta el último yen."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Yuya"
msgid "And you're gonna tell Mitsuru what you did. Whether or not\\r\nthe other hosts hear about it is up to him."
msgstr "Y le vas a contar a Mitsuru lo que hiciste. Que los otros hostesses se enteren o no,\\r\ndepende de él."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Yuya"
msgid "Oh, and don't even think about running away. One way or the\\r\nother, you're cleaning this mess up."
msgstr "Ah, y ni pienses que te vas a zafar de esta. De un modo u otro,\\r\nvas a arreglar este desastre."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Yuya"
msgid "Don't forget who's the manager, you hear? Screw with us\\r\nlike this again and you'll be sorry. I guarantee it."
msgstr "No olvides quién es el gerente, ¿entiendes? Si nos jodes de nuevo,\\r\nlo lamentarás. Te lo garantizo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "284_Shinya"
msgid "Like hell I will! And I got another piece of knowledge for\\r\nyou－I'm done with Stardust!"
msgstr "¡Claro que lo haré! Y tengo otra cosa para ti:\\r\n¡He terminado con Stardust!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Shinya"
msgid "You want your lousy 5 mil? Fine, I'll pay it! But I'm never\\r\nstepping foot in your bullshit club again!"
msgstr "¿Quieres tus míseros 5 millones? Bien, ¡los pagaré! ¡Pero no volveré a\\r\nponer un pie en tu maldito club!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Yuya"
msgid "Shinya..."
msgstr "Shinya..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Shinya"
msgid "I was never in this host business for the money."
msgstr "Nunca estuve en este negocio de hosts por el dinero."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Shinya"
msgid "All I wanted was to be the best host in Kamurocho, just like\\r\nKazuki!"
msgstr "Todo lo que quería era ser el mejor host de Kamurocho,\\r\n¡igual que Kazuki!"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "344_Kazuki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Shinya"
msgid "But once I got into the biz, I found out everyone was just\\r\na bunch of half-assed little fakers. The only thing anyone\\r\ncares about is showing off."
msgstr "Pero una vez que entré en el negocio, descubrí que todos\\r\neran solo unos farsantes a medias.\\r\nLo único que les importa es presumir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Shinya"
msgid "How was I supposed to sit back and let those posers run the\\r\nroost!? They don't have the first clue about what it means to be a host!"
msgstr "¿Cómo se suponía que me quedara de brazos cruzados y dejara\\r\nque esos farsantes se llevaran la atención? ¡No tienen ni idea de lo que significa ser un host!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Yuya"
msgid "And that's why you set Mitsuru up, huh?"
msgstr "¿Y por eso le tendiste una trampa a Mitsuru, eh?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Shinya"
msgid "Damn right. He barely lifts a fucking finger, and all he\\r\ngets is praise, praise, praise! I just can't take it\\r\nanymore!"
msgstr "Así es. Apenas mueve un dedo, ¡y todo lo que recibe son elogios!\\r\n¡Ya no puedo soportarlo más!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Yuya"
msgid "Shinya."
msgstr "Shinya."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Shinya"
msgid "I've had enough, man. Later."
msgstr "Ya tuve suficiente, amigo. Nos vemos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Yuya"
msgid "Hold on."
msgstr "Espera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Shinya"
msgid "What now!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué pasa ahora?!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Yuya"
msgid "I'm not trying to force you out of the club. Believe it or\\r\nnot, I like you."
msgstr "No intento echarte del club. Créelo o no,\\r\nme agradas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "488_Shinya"
msgid "You serious right now?"
msgstr "¿Hablas en serio?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Yuya"
msgid "And I agree with you. There's nothing worse than a host that\\r\ncomes in just looking to pick up a paycheck. Barely givin' a\\r\nshit about the club they're working for."
msgstr "Y estoy de acuerdo contigo. No hay nada peor que un host que\\r\nsolo viene por el cheque. Apenas les importa el club\\r\npara el que trabajan."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Shinya"
msgid "Yuya..."
msgstr "Yuya..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Yuya"
msgid "But the business is all about results. Sometimes guys who\\r\ncan't even tell left from right can end up the most popular\\r\nhosts in a club. It's all about what brings in business."
msgstr "Pero el negocio se trata de resultados. A veces, los chicos que ni saben distinguir\\r\nentre izquierda y derecha pueden terminar siendo los hosts más\\r\npopulares del club. Todo se trata de lo que atrae ganancias."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Shinya"
msgid "Yeah, yeah."
msgstr "Sí, sí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Kazuki"
msgid "Let him finish."
msgstr "Déjalo terminar."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Yuya"
msgid "I know you get all burned up about it. But sometimes you\\r\njust gotta keep your chin up and hang tough."
msgstr "Sé que te molesta.\\r\nPero a veces solo tienes que aguantar y resistir."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "572_Yuya"
msgid "As the manager, all I'm trying to do is give the guys who\\r\nare just as serious as I am the foothold they need to make\\r\nthat next step up."
msgstr "Como el gerente, todo lo que intento hacer es darles a los chicos\\r\nque están tan comprometidos como yo el impulso que\\r\nnecesitan para dar el siguiente paso."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Shinya"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "596_Kazuki"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Yuya"
msgid "So. If you still wanna give it a shot after all this, I'll\\r\ndo what I can to get you back on your feet."
msgstr "Así que. Si aún quieres intentarlo después de todo esto, haré lo que\\r\npueda para ayudarte a levantarte de nuevo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Kazuki"
msgid "Yuya..."
msgstr "Yuya..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_Kiryu"
msgid "(It's incredible just how much he's grown as a manager.)"
msgstr "(Es increíble cuánto ha aprendido como gerente)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Shinya"
msgid "Boss..."
msgstr "Jefe..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "656_Shinya"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Yo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "668_Shinya"
msgid "I'm so sorry!"
msgstr "¡Lo siento mucho!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "680_Woman"
msgid "Shinya-kun! *sniffle*"
msgstr "¡Shinya-kun! *solloza*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "692_Shinya"
msgid "Please give me my job back! I'll do anything, I mean it!"
msgstr "¡Por favor, devuélveme mi trabajo! ¡Haré cualquier cosa, lo prometo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "704_Kazuki"
msgid "Well?"
msgstr "¿Y bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "716_Yuya"
msgid "Fine. Let's go."
msgstr "Está bien. Vámonos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "728_Yuya"
msgid "I want Mitsuru to hear everything that happened, straight from you."
msgstr "Quiero que Mitsuru escuche todo lo que sucedió, directamente de ti."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "740_Shinya"
msgid "Right. I'm ready."
msgstr "De acuerdo. Estoy listo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "764_Kiryu"
msgid "So the guy running the top host club in Kamurocho is just a\\r\nbig softy, huh? Kind of refreshing, if you ask me."
msgstr "No sabía que el tipo que dirige el club de hosts más importante de\\r\nKamurocho es como un pancito, ¿eh? Bastante refrescante, si me preguntas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "776_Kazuki"
msgid "Haha. Refreshing is right."
msgstr "Ja, ja. Refrescante es lo más correcto, sin duda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "836_Kiryu"
msgid "Yuya handled that the only way he knew how... and it looks\\r\nlike that guy Shinya took a step in the right direction,\\r\ntoo. I think Yuya will be just fine from now on."
msgstr "Yuya manejó eso de la única forma que sabía... y parece que ese tipo\\r\nShinya dio un paso en la dirección correcta también.\\r\nCreo que Yuya estará bien de ahora en adelante."

